#: ../../export_tools/immich_export.rst:-1
msgid "digiKam Export to Immich Web-Service"
msgstr "Izvoz iz programa digiKam v spletno storitev Immich"

#: ../../export_tools/immich_export.rst:-1
msgid ""
"digiKam, documentation, user manual, photo management, open source, free, "
"learn, easy, immich, export, self-hosted"
msgstr ""
"digiKam, dokumentacija, uporabniški priročnik, upravljanje fotografij, "
"odprta koda, prosto, učenje, preprosto, Immich, izvoz, samostojno gostovanje"

#: ../../export_tools/immich_export.rst:14
msgid ":ref:`Export To Immich <export_tools>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Izvoz v Immich <export_tools>`"

#: ../../export_tools/immich_export.rst:16
msgid "This tool allows the user to upload photos to an Immich server."
msgstr "To orodje uporabniku omogoča nalaganje fotografij na strežnik Immich."

#: ../../export_tools/immich_export.rst:18
msgid ""
"`Immich <https://immich.app/>`_ is an open source, self-hosted photo and "
"video backup platform. You run the Immich server yourself, on your own "
"hardware, and this tool connects digiKam to that server so the photos you "
"manage and edit in digiKam can be published to it."
msgstr ""
"`Immich <https://immich.app/>`_ je odprtokodna platforma za samogostovanje "
"fotografij in varnostno kopiranje videoposnetkov. Strežnik Immich poganjate "
"sami na lastni strojni opremi; to orodje pa poveže program digiKam s tem "
"strežnikom, kar omogoča objavo fotografij, ki jih urejate in upravljate v "
"programu digiKam."

#: ../../export_tools/immich_export.rst:20
msgid ""
"The plugin also provides a companion download tool, described in the :ref:"
"`Import from Immich <immich_import>` chapter. Both tools share a single "
"window and the same connection settings, and each opens in its own mode: "
"this one from the :menuselection:`Export --> Export to Immich` menu entry."
msgstr ""
"Vtičnik vključuje tudi orodje za prenos podatkov, opisano v poglavju :ref:"
"`Uvoz iz Immicha <immich_import>`. Obe orodji si delita isto okno in "
"nastavitve povezave, vendar se vsako odpre v svojem načinu; to orodje "
"zaženete prek menija :menuselection:`Izvoz --> Izvozi v Immich`."

#: ../../export_tools/immich_export.rst:22
msgid ""
"Before the tool can do anything, it must connect to your server. At the top "
"of the window, enter the **Server URL** of your Immich server and the **API "
"key** to authenticate with, then press the **Connect** button. The tool "
"checks the settings, stores them for the next sessions, and loads the list "
"of albums from the server. The API key is kept in the KDE wallet when one is "
"available. With stored settings, the tool connects automatically when it "
"opens, and pressing **Connect** again reloads the albums, for example after "
"albums have been created or renamed in the Immich web interface."
msgstr ""
"Preden lahko orodje opravi kakršno koli nalogo, se mora povezati z vašim "
"strežnikom. Na vrhu okna vnesite **URL strežnika** in **ključ API** za "
"avtentikacijo, nato pa kliknite gumb **Poveži**. Orodje preveri nastavitve, "
"jih shrani za prihodnje seje in s strežnika pridobi seznam albumov. Ključ "
"API se shrani v denarnico KDE (KDE Wallet), če je ta na voljo. Ko so "
"nastavitve shranjene, se orodje ob zagonu samodejno poveže; s ponovnim "
"klikom na gumb **Poveži** lahko osvežite seznam albumov – na primer, če ste "
"v spletnem vmesniku Immich ustvarili nove albume ali preimenovali obstoječe."

#: ../../export_tools/immich_export.rst:24
msgid ""
"You create an API key in the Immich web interface, under :menuselection:"
"`Account Settings --> API Keys`. The key needs the ``asset.upload``, ``asset."
"read``, ``asset.view``, ``asset.download``, ``album.read``, ``album."
"create``, ``albumAsset.create`` and ``tag.read`` permissions. Updating the "
"metadata of photos already on the server additionally needs ``asset."
"update``, ``tag.create`` and ``tag.asset``. Stacking a replacement photo on "
"top of its previous version needs ``stack.create`` and ``stack.read``, and "
"sending the previous version to the trash needs ``asset.delete``."
msgstr ""
"Ključ API ustvarite v spletnem vmesniku Immich pod razdelkom :menuselection:"
"`Nastavitve računa --> Ključi API` (Account Settings --> API Keys). Ključ "
"mora imeti naslednja dovoljenja: ``asset.upload``, ``asset.read``, ``asset."
"view``, ``asset.download``, ``album.read``, ``album.create``, ``albumAsset."
"create`` in ``tag.read``. Za posodabljanje metapodatkov fotografij, ki so že "
"na strežniku, so potrebna še dovoljenja ``asset.update``, ``tag.create`` in "
"``tag.asset``. Za združevanje (stacking) nadomestne fotografije s prejšnjo "
"različico sta potrebni dovoljenji ``stack.create`` in ``stack.read``, za "
"premik prejšnje različice v smeti pa dovoljenje ``asset.delete``."

#: ../../export_tools/immich_export.rst:30
msgid "The Immich Export Tool Dialog"
msgstr "Pogovorno okno orodja za izvoz v Immich"

#: ../../export_tools/immich_export.rst:32
msgid ""
"By default, the tool uploads the items currently selected in digiKam. The "
"selected items are shown as thumbnails in the window, and the selection made "
"in digiKam is the upload set."
msgstr ""
"Privzeto orodje naloži elemente, ki so trenutno izbrani v programu digiKam. "
"Izbrani elementi so v oknu prikazani kot sličice, nabor za nalaganje pa "
"ustreza izboru, opravljenemu v programu digiKam."

#: ../../export_tools/immich_export.rst:34
msgid ""
"With the **Upload to** options, you choose where the photos go on the "
"server. **Library only**, the default, uploads them into the library without "
"assigning an album. The alternative is an album, chosen from the album tiles "
"below: the tiles are sorted by name, a filter field narrows the list, and "
"the **New Album** button creates a new album on the server. The chosen "
"target is remembered for the next session."
msgstr ""
"Z možnostmi v razdelku **Prenesi v** (Upload to) določite, kam na strežniku "
"se bodo fotografije shranile. Privzeta možnost je **Samo knjižnica**, pri "
"kateri se fotografije naložijo v knjižnico, ne da bi bile dodeljene "
"določenemu albumu. Druga možnost je izbira albuma prek ploščic z albumi, ki "
"so prikazane spodaj; ploščice so razvrščene po imenu, seznam lahko zožite s "
"pomočjo filtra, gumb **Novi album** pa na strežniku ustvari nov album. "
"Izbrana ciljna lokacija se shrani za naslednjo uporabo."

#: ../../export_tools/immich_export.rst:36
msgid ""
"The **Edited photos** option decides what happens when a photo you upload is "
"recognised as a new version of one the server already has, as described in "
"the re-exporting section below. **Stack**, the default, places the new "
"version on top of the old one as the primary of a stack. **Overwrite** sends "
"the old version to the Immich trash instead."
msgstr ""
"Možnost **Obdelane fotografije** določa, kaj se zgodi, če je fotografija, ki "
"jo nalagate, prepoznana kot nova različica datoteke, ki na strežniku že "
"obstaja (več o tem v razdelku o ponovnem izvozu spodaj). Privzeta možnost "
"**Zloženo** postavi novo različico na vrh stare in jo določi kot glavno v "
"nizu (t. i. skladu). Možnost **Prepiši** pa staro različico premakne v koš "
"aplikacije Immich."

#: ../../export_tools/immich_export.rst:42
msgid "The Immich Export Uploading in Progress"
msgstr "Prenašanje v Immich v teku"

#: ../../export_tools/immich_export.rst:44
msgid ""
"Press the **Upload selection** button to transfer the items. A progress bar "
"follows the transfer, the **Cancel** button aborts it, and when the transfer "
"ends a line in the window summarises the outcome, with the counts of "
"uploaded, updated and skipped items."
msgstr ""
"Za prenos elementov kliknite gumb **Prenesi tja izbor**. Potek prenosa "
"prikazuje vrstica napredka, s klikom na gumb **Prekliči** pa lahko postopek "
"prekinete. Ko je prenos končan, se v oknu prikaže povzetek rezultata, ki "
"vključuje število naloženih, posodobljenih in izpuščenih elementov."

#: ../../export_tools/immich_export.rst:47
msgid "Re-exporting Photos"
msgstr "Ponovni izvoz fotografij"

#: ../../export_tools/immich_export.rst:49
msgid ""
"Exporting the same selection again is safe, and never produces a duplicate "
"on the server. The tool recognises a file as one the server already has from "
"its file name, capture time and dimensions, confirmed by comparing its "
"pixels with the server copy. What happens next depends on what changed since "
"the last export:"
msgstr ""
"Ponovni izvoz iste izbire je varen in na strežniku nikoli ne ustvari "
"dvojnika. Orodje prepozna datoteko kot eno, ki jo strežnik že ima, na "
"podlagi imena datoteke, časa zajemanja in dimenzij, kar potrdi s primerjavo "
"slikovnih pik s kopijo na strežniku. Nadaljnji koraki so odvisni od tega, "
"kaj se je spremenilo od zadnjega izvoza:"

#: ../../export_tools/immich_export.rst:51
msgid ""
"If nothing changed, nothing is uploaded, and only metadata differences are "
"written, as below."
msgstr ""
"Če se ni nič spremenilo, se nič ne naloži in zapišejo se le razlike v "
"metapodatkih, kot je prikazano spodaj."

#: ../../export_tools/immich_export.rst:53
msgid ""
"If only the metadata changed, the pixels being identical, nothing is "
"uploaded either. The changed tags, rating, caption and GPS position are "
"written to the existing photo on the server through the API. Tag changes are "
"additive: a tag removed in digiKam is not removed on the server."
msgstr ""
"Če so se spremenili samo metapodatki, slikovne pike pa so enake, se tudi nič "
"ne naloži. Spremenjene oznake, ocena, napis in položaj GPS se prek API-ja "
"zapišejo na obstoječo fotografijo na strežniku. Spremembe oznak so aditivne: "
"oznaka, odstranjena v digiKamu, se na strežniku ne odstrani."

#: ../../export_tools/immich_export.rst:55
msgid ""
"If the picture itself was edited, the new version is uploaded and added to "
"every album the old version belonged to. With **Stack**, it becomes the "
"primary of a stack with the old version. With **Overwrite**, the old version "
"is moved to the Immich trash, where it can be recovered for 30 days. In both "
"cases the replacement is a new photo on the server: links shared from the "
"old version do not carry over, and edits made to the old version inside "
"Immich are lost."
msgstr ""
"Če je bila sama slika obdelana, se nova različica naloži in doda v vsak "
"album, ki mu je pripadala stara različica. Z možnostjo **Stack** postane "
"primarna v skladu s staro različico. Z možnostjo **Prepiši** se stara "
"različica premakne v koš Immich, kjer jo je mogoče obnoviti 30 dni. V obeh "
"primerih je zamenjava nova fotografija na strežniku: povezave, deljene iz "
"stare različice, se ne prenesejo, spremembe stare različice, narejene v "
"Immichu, pa se izgubijo."

#: ../../export_tools/immich_export.rst:57
msgid ""
"If the photo was cropped or resized, so its dimensions no longer match, it "
"is only replaced when a check confirms the local image is a crop of the "
"server photo."
msgstr ""
"Če je bila fotografija obrezana ali spremenjena njena velikost, tako da se "
"njene dimenzije ne ujemajo več, se zamenja šele, ko preverjanje potrdi, da "
"je lokalna slika obrez fotografije na strežniku."

#: ../../export_tools/immich_export.rst:59
msgid ""
"If the evidence is ambiguous, nothing is overwritten or stacked, and the "
"file is uploaded as a new photo."
msgstr ""
"Če so dokazi dvoumni, se nič ne prepiše ali zloži, datoteka pa se naloži kot "
"nova fotografija."

#: ../../export_tools/immich_export.rst:61
msgid ""
"A renamed file cannot be recognised, because recognition needs the file name "
"and the capture time to survive the edit. Files the tool cannot decode, such "
"as RAW files, are never replaced or stacked; their metadata still "
"synchronises."
msgstr ""
"Preimenovane datoteke ni mogoče prepoznati, ker je za prepoznavanje potrebno "
"ime datoteke in čas zajemanja, da preživi urejanje. Datoteke, ki jih orodje "
"ne more dekodirati, na primer datoteke RAW, niso nikoli zamenjane ali "
"zložene; njihovi metapodatki se še vedno sinhronizirajo."

#: ../../export_tools/immich_export.rst:64
msgid "How Metadata Travels"
msgstr "Kako potujejo metapodatki"

#: ../../export_tools/immich_export.rst:66
msgid ""
"Metadata travels between digiKam and Immich in XMP sidecar files, which both "
"applications read and write. On upload, the tool generates a sidecar from "
"the metadata in digiKam's database, holding the tags, the rating, the "
"caption and the GPS position, and merges it over the file's existing XMP, so "
"properties the tool does not set, colour labels included, survive the round "
"trip. On download, the sidecar written by Immich is stored next to each "
"original."
msgstr ""
"Metapodatki potujejo med digiKam in Immich v priklopnih datotekah XMP, ki "
"jih obe aplikaciji bereta in pišeta. Pri nalaganju orodje ustvari priklopno "
"datoteko iz metapodatkov v zbirki podatkov digiKam, ki vsebuje oznake, "
"oceno, napis in položaj GPS, ter jo združi z obstoječim XMP datoteke, tako "
"da lastnosti, ki jih orodje ne nastavi, vključno z barvnimi oznakami, "
"preživijo povratno potovanje. Pri prenosu je priklopna datoteka, ki jo je "
"napisal Immich, shranjena poleg vsakega izvirnika."

#: ../../export_tools/immich_export.rst:68
msgid ""
"Pixel edits do not travel in XMP. Only rendered exports, such as JPEG or "
"TIFF files, carry pixel changes back to Immich."
msgstr ""
"Urejanja slikovnih pik ne potujejo v XMP. Samo upodobljeni izvozi, kot so "
"datoteke JPEG ali TIFF, prenesejo spremembe slikovnih pik nazaj v Immich."
